# A rename target with a trailing slash names a folder (as for `mv` and
# the New-file prompt): `newdir/` moves a.txt INTO a new newdir, keeping
# its name, instead of renaming the file to `newdir`.
write a.txt "aa"
command view.focus_tree
key r
key home
key f2
key ctrl+u
type newdir/
key enter
wait 300
expect file newdir/a.txt contains "aa"
